# Server API

- Use `wrap()` for async handlers; DB transient errors → 503 retry in main wrap
- Role groups: `server/lib/rbac-constants.mjs` — KOMISION, KOMISION_CORE
- New routes: prefer `server/routes/<domain>.mjs` with `registerXRoutes(app, deps)`
- App factory: `server/createApp.mjs` — shared CORS + JSON + attachUser
- Vercel entry re-exports full app: `api/index.mjs`
- Never expose admin utilities without `requireRole('SUPERADMIN')`
